===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# A [[chronic]] [[disease]] caused by [[compulsive]] and uncontrollable consumption of [[alcohol]]ic [[beverage]]s, leading to [[addiction]] and deterioration in health and social functioning.
#: {{syn|en|dipsomania|German vice}}
# {{lb|en|pathology}} Acute [[alcohol poisoning]].

